*.html

/.quarto/

**/*.quarto_ipynb

# tinytable_assets/ are NOT ignored: modelsummary writes inline table images
# there and the rendered pages reference them. They are excluded from the
# student bundles by scripts/build-bundles.py instead.
/_site/
# _freeze/ is intentionally committed

# _preserved/ holds the 2022 build assets that cannot be regenerated:
# site_libs (no revealjs document is rendered any more, and current Quarto
# emits different asset names) and the two exercise pages excluded from the
# render list. These must be tracked despite the *.html and *_files/ rules.
!_preserved/
!_preserved/**
